WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 line:0
Ninety-Nine: the total may not pass 99.
You are North; with no legal card, you are out.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000 line:0
Click ♥8 to play it; a card is drawn for you.
The total goes from 0 to 8.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:0
Fast-forward: number cards add; non-spade A adds 1.
K sets 99, 4 reverses, the ♠A resets to 0.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.750 line:0
West plays a 5 and picks North to act next.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:36.000 line:0
North plays a 5 and clicks East’s seat:
a 5 keeps the total and picks the next player.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.999 line:0
Fast-forward: the closer the total is to 99,
the fewer cards you can play.

00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:52.999 line:0
Click ♥Q, then press −20: the total drops
from 99 to 79. A 10 can add or subtract too.

00:00:52.999 --> 00:00:59.999 line:0
Fast-forward: play goes on
with the total hovering near 99.

00:00:59.999 --> 00:01:06.999 line:0
After West plays, South cannot play
any of five cards and is eliminated.

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:16.998 line:0
Fast-forward: East and West are eliminated
too, until one player is left.

00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:25.000 line:0
North is the last survivor and wins;
South, East and West were eliminated in order.
